        "notes": [
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0ltj_0",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "opening",
            "message": "The opening metaphor of the 'lying lamp' is a fantastic hook that immediately establishes the magical mechanics and the protagonist's character."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0ltj_1",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "characterization",
            "message": "The 'Company' dynamics are excellently established through brief, sharp dialogue that defines their hierarchy without heavy exposition."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0ltj_2",
            "severity": "suggest",
            "category": "pacing",
            "message": "The transition between the lamp scene and the Commission Hall is quite abrupt; a small beat of Cael traveling or transitioning her mindset would smooth the jump."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0ltj_3",
            "severity": "suggest",
            "category": "show-don't-tell",
            "message": "In the final scene, 'Because you and the same, Cael did not say' is a bit heavy-handed; let the subtext of their shared glances do that heavy lifting."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0ltj_4",
            "severity": "flag",
            "category": "voice",
            "message": "The phrase 'a face like a closed ledger' feels a bit cliché compared to the highly original prose found in the rest of the chapter."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0ltj_5",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "tension",
            "message": "The humming token creates a great sensory bridge between the opening mystery and the upcoming plot conflict."
          }
        ],
        "model": "gemma-4-26b-a4b-qat"
      },
      "error": null
    },
    {
      "featureKey": "critique",
      "ok": true,
      "started": "2026-07-21T07:00:22.523Z",
      "label": "Chapter critique",
      "wallMs": 17698,
      "ttftMs": null,
      "outputChars": 1910,
      "usage": null,
      "flags": [],
      "extra": {
        "chapterId": "ch1",
        "chapterNum": 1,
        "chapterWords": 2600,
        "noteCount": 8,
        "notes": [
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_0",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "opening",
            "message": "The opening hook 'A lamp that will not lie' is striking and immediately establishes the central conceit of the world."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_1",
            "severity": "suggest",
            "category": "show-don't-tell",
            "message": "The phrase 'a woman who could not afford to be interesting' is a brilliant piece of characterization, but the internal monologue about the Schools and Wardens feels slightly heavy-handed in explaining the stakes too early."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_2",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "voice",
            "message": "The prose has a wonderful, rhythmic quality, particularly in the description of the father's stool and the salt smell of the harbor."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_3",
            "severity": "suggest",
            "category": "pacing",
            "message": "The transition between the shop scene and the Commission Hall is abrupt; a small sensory bridge (the change in smell or temperature) could smooth the jump."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_4",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "characterization",
            "message": "The 'Company' dynamics are established efficiently through dialogue, making the group feel lived-in without a massive info-dump."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_5",
            "severity": "suggest",
            "category": "clarity",
            "message": "The distinction between 'Concern' (the entity) and 'Concern' (the type of work/seal) gets slightly muddy in the Commission Hall section."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_6",
            "severity": "info",
            "category": "tension",
            "message": "The humming token provides an excellent physical manifestation of the mounting dread as the chapter concludes."
          },
          {
            "id": "note_mrub0zh8_7",
            "severity": "suggest",
            "category": "dialogue",
            "message": "Nettle's dialogue in the final scene is a bit too 'on the nose' regarding Cael's secrets; consider making her observations more oblique to maintain her mystery."
          }
        ],
        "model": "gemma-4-26b-a4b-qat"
